# Molten Duplication on Grizzly Bears (CR 707.2, 707.9b, 702.10): the token is a copy except it is an artifact in addition to its other types, it
# gains haste until end of turn so it attacks the turn it is made while the original (cast this turn, no haste) cannot, and it is sacrificed at the
# beginning of the next end step (CR 603.7c) while the original stays. Bot2's Memnite is not Bot1's, so it is no target (CR 115.1).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Grizzly Bears
Molten Duplication
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Grizzly Bears.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Molten Duplication.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears#2.Token = true
? Bot1.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears#2.Types = Creature; Artifact
? Bot1.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears#2.Keywords = Haste
? Bot1.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears#1.Types = Creature
? Bot1.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears#1.Keywords = (absent)
[T1 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Bot1.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears#2 > Bot2)
[T1 Bot1.End]
? Bot2.Life = 18
[T2 Bot2.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears.Types = Creature
Bot1.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears#2 = (absent)
